sentences.l:
So I spoke, and they quickly to my words were persuaded,
and, uncovering themselves, along the shore of the unharvested salt-sea
they gazed at the stag;

O friends, for we know not where is the gloom nor where the dawn,
nor where the mortal-lighting sun goes under the earth,
nor where it rises again;

‘O friends, within for someone, at a great loom going to and fro,
sings finely, and the whole floor echoes all round,
either goddess or woman;

and she seated them, bringing them in, along the seats and the chairs,
and for them cheese and barley-meal and yellow honey
with Pramnian wine she stirred;
